{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"55c6f6d2c911aefcc08144441512250015f962b2f8ce746bc6cf2721642444e6","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot-ops runbook","key_entities":["infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","var.aws_region","versions.tf","i-00880b2c7f13527c5","us-east-1","896586841071","autodeploy.sh","install-autodeploy.sh","BOT_PATHS","aws ssm start-session","aws ssm send-command"],"problem_keywords":["documentation","runbook","operational guidance","missing instance metadata","SSM Session Manager","automation deployment"],"propositions":["The review-bot-ops runbook lacks the prod instance ID and region needed for operators to connect via SSM Session Manager, forcing them to guess.","Instance ID and region are single-sourced in terraform (var.aws_region default, versions.tf backend) and ADR-0026 but not surfaced in the operational runbook.","The runbook needs accurate documentation of autodeploy.sh self-update behavior: the script body auto-updates via BOT_PATHS rsync, but script-only changes require hand-deployment to take effect immediately.","The installer (install-autodeploy.sh) and systemd unit files are excluded from in-run re-materialization and always require hand-deployment."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787476515869017001,"uuid":"9aa493f8-2c15-41eb-823e-e010b63b433b"}